parameters.text:
=Act as an expert sales copywriter. Create a warm, personalized nurturing email for this new lead.

Lead Info:
Name: {{ $json.leadName }}
Source: {{ $json.leadSource }}
Message: {{ $json.message }}

Product Context: High-value SaaS solution for workflow automation.

Write an engaging first email under 150 words that builds rapport and offers value.

parameters.jsCode:
const item = $input.item.json;
return {
  json: {
    ...item,
    emailSubject: 'Welcome! Let\'s get you started with automation',
    emailBody: item.response || item.text || 'Thank you for your interest...',
    status: 'Email Sent - Day 1',
    lastInteraction: new Date().toISOString()
  }
};
